 transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> electrons.</p></p>\n\n<h3>(b) Matching Total Electrons Among the Options</h3>\n<p>Let us see how many electrons are in each species:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.748ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1214.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> has <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.308ex\" height=\"1.557ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 4556 688\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2500.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3556,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g